    "created_at": "2018-01-29T13:37:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-01-29T13:37:24Z",
    "body": "I guess we should leave the specification as-is then, but call it out as an intentional difference between the setter and getter. And maybe we should point out that for CSS purposes a different body element definition is used.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
